    "prespecified": "Fixed 2026-11-22 after the pilot gate (run 44981752264: no deaths in 10 arms, 3 arms lose the Ranger 226104090, depth falls 0.1-0.3 in the leash arms) and before any result of this tier was read. Small tier (RULES 14) on the same build:\nclasses-1800 starts 1-90 (90 starts per arm, paired), all classes, 100,000 turns, one binary, disjoint from the other tiers of\nthe study (pool them as one study, RULES 14). All 13 arms of the pilot. Progress (alive at the cap with DL5 reached) is part of the question: a short leash can leave a Borg with nothing to do. Money scum stays out (RULES 15).\nGate: no config_error; one binary; every cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; stalls and wall timeouts reported start by\nstart. Report per arm and class: deaths and causes, CL at death, final and maximum level, deepest level, alive at the cap having\nreached DL5; paired rescued and newly killed against the control (exact McNemar), identical plays; a RULES 18 bin. Evidence is not\nretained at this tier. Descriptive.",
